          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising kinetic operations (naval strikes, mining, missile strikes near ports and lanes) directly increase the probability of interruptions and hazards to merchant traffic transiting key maritime chokepoints (e.g., Black Sea access, Turkish Straits), raising disruption risk." />
