          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising public and elite threat perceptions raise the expected frequency of energy/supply shocks and fiscal support, causing markets to price in earlier and/or larger central‑bank tightening (shift toward tighter policy expectations)." />
