          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising public and elite threat perceptions push policymakers to rapidly introduce and enforce stricter export controls, vetting, and deployment restrictions on AI technologies for national security reasons, raising regulatory stringency." />
