          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise/fall in net cross-border capital flows directly increases/decreases the pool of international VC, private equity and portfolio funding available to AI startups and scaleups, changing the rate of AI investment within a few fundraising cycles." />
